{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:45:665","content":{"id":665,"title":"同步动画","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d6ccca4a-4b12-4069-8018-e193c1a78e7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当页面上多个动画有先后顺序时，比如当前一个动画完成时，后一个动画才开始，这样的动画我们称为同步动画。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"54bb7ff5-497e-45db-aadd-ec4a403c87c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个可以设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"begin"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性来锚定某个动画来实现同步动画，举个🌰"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"a90255dc-f764-43c2-a6ab-91c970f3ec9f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4a1290d5-2322-4073-954c-3132535f516c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<svg width=\"400\" height=\"350\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 350\">\n  <rect width=\"100\" height=\"100\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"#1a66ff\">\n    <animate\n      id=\"c1\"\n      attributeName=\"width\"\n      attributeType=\"XML\"\n      from=\"100\" to=\"400\"\n      begin=\"0s\" dur=\"3s\"\n      fill=\"freeze\" \n     />\n  </rect>\n  <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"220\" r=\"0\" fill=\"#1a66ff\">\n    <animate \n      attributeName=\"r\"\n      attributeType=\"XML\"\n      from=\"0\" to=\"100\"\n      begin=\"c1.end\" dur=\"2s\"\n      fill=\"freeze\" \n    />\n  </circle>\n</svg>","collabId":"0f508791-c4ee-4ec0-ac36-601d0da300b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<svg width=\"400\" height=\"350\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 350\">\n  <rect width=\"100\" height=\"100\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"#1a66ff\">\n    <animate\n      id=\"c1\"\n      attributeName=\"width\"\n      attributeType=\"XML\"\n      from=\"100\" to=\"400\"\n      begin=\"0s\" dur=\"3s\"\n      fill=\"freeze\" \n     />\n  </rect>\n  <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"220\" r=\"0\" fill=\"#1a66ff\">\n    <animate \n      attributeName=\"r\"\n      attributeType=\"XML\"\n      from=\"0\" to=\"100\"\n      begin=\"c1.end\" dur=\"2s\"\n      fill=\"freeze\" \n    />\n  </circle>\n</svg>","collabId":"11a212e5-9d06-4a0c-a81a-7f9e5ebf6b19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2407f2c1-711b-4aa4-b59c-8f67a33fb81e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面定义了一个矩形逐渐变宽的动画和一个圆逐渐变大的动画，注意到圆动画开始的时间我设置为了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"begin=\"c1.end\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"c1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是矩形动画的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"id"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这个意思就是圆动画开始时间是矩形动画的结束时间。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e6b5a763-55ae-46e4-889b-0747322172de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们还可以添加一个偏移量，比如我们希望圆动画在矩形动画结束之后再经过两秒开始，我们就可以设置圆动画的起始时间为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"begin=\"c1.end+2s\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3f01848b-1665-46c2-9c41-9f856a95f100","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果希望圆动画在矩形动画开始两秒后开始动画，这个时候我们可以设置圆动画的开始时间为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"begin=\"c1.begin+2s\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"775f3dd6-50eb-4996-83ed-d4f17f2d04bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果我们希望某个元素的动画在另一个动画重复指定次数时开始，可以指定属性 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"begin=\"id.repeat(count)+offset\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"count"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 从 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开始计数"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"f1179e1a-efd3-4968-a1ef-7f83e316aadf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6b872f19-eea6-4934-a330-67cf786c8777","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<svg width=\"400\" height=\"350\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 350\">\n  <rect width=\"100\" height=\"100\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\">\n    <animate\n      id=\"rec\"\n      attributeName=\"width\"\n      attributeType=\"XML\"\n      from=\"100\" to=\"400\"\n      begin=\"0s\" dur=\"3s\"\n      repeatCount=\"2\"\n      fill=\"freeze\" />\n  </rect>\n  <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"220\" r=\"0\" >\n    <animate \n      attributeName=\"r\"\n      attributeType=\"XML\"\n      from=\"0\" to=\"100\"\n      <!-- 在矩形动画第一次重复时，圆动画开始执行。  -->\n      begin=\"rec.repeat(1)\" dur=\"3s\"\n      fill=\"freeze\" />\n  </circle>\n</svg>","collabId":"47012e2f-25d6-43b3-ad29-e4934aca897a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<svg width=\"400\" height=\"350\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 350\">\n  <rect width=\"100\" height=\"100\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"#1a66ff\">\n    <animate\n      id=\"rec\"\n      attributeName=\"width\"\n      attributeType=\"XML\"\n      from=\"100\" to=\"400\"\n      begin=\"0s\" dur=\"3s\"\n      repeatCount=\"2\"\n      fill=\"freeze\" \n    />\n  </rect>\n  <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"220\" r=\"0\" fill=\"#1a66ff\">\n    <animate \n      attributeName=\"r\"\n      attributeType=\"XML\"\n      from=\"0\" to=\"100\"\n      begin=\"rec.repeat(1)\" dur=\"3s\"\n      fill=\"freeze\" \n   />\n  </circle>\n</svg>","collabId":"852d378a-c54b-4673-b4e2-5225e2d2410a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c27dc241-67b8-4545-9e46-5a03e738af44","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一般而言，动画的结束时间就是动画的持续时间，但是我们可以通过设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"end"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性改变这一点，它是用来设置动画的结束时间的。这个时候你可能会问，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"end"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性如果和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dur"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性设置的不一样，那不就冲突了吗？这个时候动画的结束时间以谁为准呢？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b6b53ed6-38a3-4fd2-8674-1078aa26c705","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"答案就是哪个先结束就以哪个为准。例如动画持续时间设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dur=\"3s\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"，结束时间设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"end=\"5s\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么就以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dur"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为准；反过来如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dur=\"5s\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"end=\"3s\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么动画结束时间就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"3s"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并且动画处于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"3s"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时的状态，而不是结束状态，通过这种方法我们可以查看动画的中间状态。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"SVG","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:648","type":"doc","id":648}},{"label":"动画","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:649","type":"doc","id":649}},{"label":"同步动画","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:665","type":"doc","id":665}}],"prevPage":{"title":"animate","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:650","type":"doc","id":650}},"nextPage":{"title":"animateTransform","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:666","type":"doc","id":666}},"createTime":1703605686447,"updateTime":1743303640566,"projectId":45},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640566},"pluginRenderers":[{"runtimeVersion":1,"manifest":{"id":"tau.html","name":"HTML","version":"0.1.11","categories":["editor","ai"],"keywords":["HTML","网页","嵌入"],"apiVersion":1,"format":"cjs","main":"main.js","styles":"main.css","skills":["authoring"],"integrity":{"main.js":"968d6dd4153a56e6a91e0990d98b68c75255776b56b323facc1bfd5037fe0602","main.css":"468f2feb73a33e5711b1583b609e4ab3818e83d5f19a38dcd9d027b77eb269d8","skills/authoring/SKILL.md":"5a476fc110584964ab053cb40f0399ec27125bc1d315b6d50b019fbd9b112aa0"},"formatVersion":3,"platform":"portable","profile":"web-v1","description":"在文档中编辑行内与块级 HTML，支持 Tailwind 样式、博客发布和静态导出。","targets":{"desktop":{"minAppVersion":"0.59.5"},"android":{"minAppVersion":"0.2.7"},"ios":{"minAppVersion":"0.2.7"}}},"entry":"../../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.11/fc2c10e9d04101645a92fb3123d7d6c355005213fcb06e9f3dab58168bbab594/main.js","styles":"../../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.11/fc2c10e9d04101645a92fb3123d7d6c355005213fcb06e9f3dab58168bbab594/style.css","nodeTypes":["html-block","html-inline"]}],"contentStyles":[{"href":"../../styles/54a89023be83c8a0e9757be1a25e13b9874c28a06c3221b5d5a9bf021fb67a2d.css","integrity":"54a89023be83c8a0e9757be1a25e13b9874c28a06c3221b5d5a9bf021fb67a2d"}]}